                                                "sense_id": "6dff488f-28f6-33ff-b102-3fcd07a3ecdc",
                                                "text": "I have done past life regressions on my own through self-hypnosis techniques that I learned in Brian Weiss's book Many Lives, Many Masters as well as with past life regression tapes."
